WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.200
Friday, 6:40 pm. The tests pass.

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.600
Just one more line.

00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:07.600
Nobody re-runs the tests.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:11.300
The weekend.

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:15.800
Monday, 9:12 am. Codex reads the briefing.

00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:20.300
The pass no longer counts.

00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:30.400
It re-runs. It fails.

00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:34.200
Fixed, and verified again.

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:45.400
The task replay shows where it went stale.

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:48.400
The tick goes amber when the code moves under it.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.500
Continuum. npx getcontinuum setup claude-code
